Learning the basics of vi that you can  use to edit
your .nethackrc in dgamelaunch is easy.

Vi is modal, the three modes you'll concern yourself with are:
command mode (which it starts in)

and insert mode, which you enter with a simple "i" command and
exit with the Esc key.

And the "ex" mode in which you can use certain commands.  You
use that by typing ":" and then the command.

In command mode you can:
delete characters with "x"
delete whole lines with "dd"
save and exit vi with "ZZ"  yes capital Z's 

Insert mode is where you enter your text, of course.

Ex mode lets you use some commands like:
:wq! to save and exit
:q! to exit without saving.


That's really all you'll need to know.

